Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Pivot
Source: https://github.com/pivotlake/pivot
Comment: The binary links third-party components statically. Those present in
 the source tree have their own paragraphs below. The Rust dependencies are
 fetched at build time rather than shipped as sources, so they have none; they
 and everything else are inventoried in /usr/share/doc/pivot/NOTICE, which this
 package installs.

