Files: duckdb-planner/duckdb-sources/*
Copyright: 2018-2026 Stichting DuckDB Foundation
License: MIT
Comment: Linked statically, with its parquet, core_functions and icu
 extensions. DuckDB vendors its own third-party components, which are
 therefore also present in the binary, among them brotli, fast_float,
 fastpforlib, fmt, fsst, httplib, hyperloglog, jaro_winkler, lz4, mbedtls,
 miniz, pcg, pdqsort, re2, skiplist, snappy, snowball, tdigest, thrift,
 utf8proc, yyjson and zstd. The icu extension embeds International
 Components for Unicode, under the Unicode License.

